msgid "**Dashboard shows $0.0000 for all agents after configuring rates.** Old records are immutable, they were recorded with `cost_usd = 0` because no rate was set when they happened. Make a new chat request after the daemon reload and check **Cost overview > Session** plus **Spend by model**; both should populate for the new request."
