msgid "**Long paths.** Some Windows file systems still cap path lengths at 260 characters. Enable long path support if you hit `path too long` errors during a source build:"
msgstr "**长路径。** 某些 Windows 文件系统仍将路径长度限制为 260 个字符。如果你在源码构建期间遇到 `path too long` 错误，请启用长路径支持："

