msgstr "**限制哪些人可以访问该代理：** [Peer Groups](./peer-groups.md)。"

#: src/channels/social.md
msgid "**Restrict who the agent will respond to.** Gate inbound senders with a peer group (per channel, above): an empty peer set denies everyone, `[\"*\"]` accepts anyone. Bluesky has no peer-group sender field; gate at the autonomy / tool layer instead."
msgstr "**限制 agent 将响应的对象。** 使用对等组（每个通道，见上文）来控制入站发送者：空对等集会拒绝所有人，`[\"*\"]` 则接受任何人。Bluesky 没有对等组发送者字段；请改为在自治／工具层进行控制。"

