msgstr "\"prompt\": \"Summarise the changes in the last commit.\""

#: src/agents/history-management.md
msgid "**Structured message-count trimming** mutates `Agent::history` (`ConversationMessage`) used by RPC, gateway, and ACP `Agent` turns when it exceeds the structured agent's effective message cap. Daemon channel loops that call the legacy `agent::run` path use the separate raw-message cap described below."
msgstr "**结构化消息数量修剪**在超出结构化 agent 的有效消息上限时，会修改 RPC、网关和 ACP `Agent` 轮次所使用的 `Agent::history`（`ConversationMessage`）。调用旧版 `agent::run` 路径的守护进程通道循环使用下文所述的独立原始消息上限。"

