#: src/setup/windows.md
msgid "**`ENTRYPOINT [\"zeroclaw\"]`**, `CMD [\"daemon\"]`: running with no args starts the daemon and gateway"
msgstr "**`ENTRYPOINT [\"zeroclaw\"]`**, `CMD [\"daemon\"]`：不带参数运行时会启动守护进程和网关"

