msgid "A SubAgent inherits the parent's permissions verbatim unless the spawn site supplies a narrowing `SubAgentOverrides`. Today both in-tree spawn sites pass `SubAgentOverrides::default()` (inherit everything). The override surface is shipped and validated; a future caller-supplied narrowing path drops in without runtime changes."
