#: src/developing/how-plugins-work.md
msgid "A host meant to load third-party plugins should set `enabled = true`, `signature_mode = \"strict\"`, and list only the publisher keys you trust. A host that runs only plugins you build yourself can leave `signature_mode` at its `disabled` default during development and tighten it before the host is shared."
msgstr "用于加载第三方插件的主机应设置 `enabled = true`、`signature_mode = \"strict\"`，并且只列出你信任的发布者密钥。只运行你自己构建的插件的主机可以在开发期间将 `signature_mode` 保持为其 `disabled` 默认值，并在主机共享之前将其收紧。"

