#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-008-goal-mode-control-plane-and-usage-accounting.md
msgid "A single trusted admission gate prevents command and model-initiated entry paths from becoming separate authorization systems. The cost is that every supported surface must route goal entry through the shared command/admission machinery."
msgstr "单一可信的准入门可防止命令和模型发起的进入路径演变成彼此独立的授权系统。代价是，所有受支持的界面都必须通过共享的命令/准入机制处理目标输入。"

#: src/foundations/fnd-006-zero-compromise-in-practice.md
msgid "A single workflow in a single file"
msgstr "单个文件中的单个工作流"

#: src/tools/skill-bundles.md
msgid "A skill bundle is the one plugin kind that ships no WebAssembly at all. It is a directory of markdown skills, packaged and distributed through the plugin machinery: same manifest, same discovery, same signature policy, same `zeroclaw plugin install`. Use it when the capability you are adding is instructions, prompts, and workflows rather than code, and you want plugin distribution semantics (signing, registry install, versioning) instead of loose files in a skills directory."
msgstr "技能包是一种插件类型，完全不包含任何 WebAssembly。它是一个 markdown 技能目录，通过插件机制进行打包和分发：相同的清单、相同的发现方式、相同的签名策略、相同的 `zeroclaw plugin install`。当你要添加的能力是说明、提示和工作流，而不是代码，并且你希望使用插件分发语义（签名、注册表安装、版本管理），而不是 skills 目录中的松散文件时，就使用它。"

#: src/tools/skills.md
msgid "A skill can also be a structured TOML manifest (`SKILL.toml`). The `[skill]` table requires `name` and `description`; `version` defaults to `0.1.0` when omitted; `author`, `tags`, `prompts`, and `always` are optional (`always` defaults to `false`; see above). Tool entries may use `kind = \"shell\"`, `kind = \"http\"`, or `kind = \"script\"`. Keep tool descriptions narrow and concrete so the model knows when to use them."
msgstr "技能也可以是结构化的 TOML 清单（`SKILL.toml`）。`[skill]` 表要求包含 `name` 和 `description`；省略 `version` 时其默认值为 `0.1.0`；`author`、`tags`、`prompts` 和 `always` 均为可选项（`always` 默认为 `false`；见上文）。工具条目可以使用 `kind = \"shell\"`、`kind = \"http\"` 或 `kind = \"script\"`。工具描述应保持聚焦且具体，以便模型知道何时使用它们。"

#: src/tools/skill-bundles.md
msgid "A skill may carry a `scripts/` directory. Whether script-bearing skills load is governed by the operator's `skills.allow_scripts` setting, which the plugin-skill loader passes through unchanged (`discover_plugin_skills` in `skills/mod.rs`): a bundle skill with scripts is subject to exactly the same audit-and-drop rules as a workspace skill. Do not assume your scripts run just because the bundle installed."
msgstr "一个技能可以携带一个 `scripts/` 目录。是否加载带脚本的技能由操作者的 `skills.allow_scripts` 设置决定，插件技能加载器会原样传递该设置（`skills/mod.rs` 中的 `discover_plugin_skills`）：带脚本的捆绑包技能与工作区技能完全受相同的审核并丢弃规则约束。不要仅仅因为捆绑包已安装就假定你的脚本会运行。"

#: src/tools/skills.md
msgid "A skill tagged `slash` is surfaced as a chat-channel slash command (e.g. Discord `/search`). It may declare typed `[[skill.slash_options]]`; a skill that declares none falls back to a single required free-text input. Both the command description and each option description accept an optional `description_localizations` map keyed by locale code. Unknown or unsupported locale codes are dropped with a warning rather than failing registration, so a typo never wedges command registration."
msgstr "标记为 `slash` 的技能会以聊天频道斜杠命令的形式展示（例如 Discord `/search`）。它可以声明带类型的 `[[skill.slash_options]]`；未声明任何选项的技能会回退为一个必填的自由文本输入。命令描述和每个选项描述都可接受一个可选的 `description_localizations` 映射，以区域设置代码为键。未知或不受支持的区域设置代码会被丢弃并给出警告，而不是导致注册失败，因此拼写错误不会卡住命令注册。"

#: src/tools/skill-bundles.md
msgid "A skill-only plugin omits `wasm_path` and carries a `skills/` directory in [agentskills.io](https://agentskills.io) format:"
msgstr "仅技能插件会省略 `wasm_path`，并包含符合 [agentskills.io](https://agentskills.io) 格式的 `skills/` 目录："

