msgid "ACP/Code sessions, including ZeroCode's ACP pane, remain isolated from automatic long-term-memory injection. Knowledge bundles and retrieval-augmented generation are separate deliberate context sources; they do not turn curated memory back on for those Code sessions."
msgstr "ACP/Code 会话（包括 ZeroCode 的 ACP 面板）与自动长期记忆注入保持隔离。知识包和检索增强生成是独立的、需主动配置的上下文来源；它们不会为这些 Code 会话重新启用经过整理的记忆。"

