#: src/sop/fan-in/channel.md
msgid "All channel deliveries enter the runtime's shared SOP ingress adapter before an event is built. The adapter owns source-interest checks, required engine/audit handle diagnostics, untrusted input capping, event timestamps, and dispatch-result logging. Channel code supplies only the transport-owned topic and payload. Forge events use the same boundary with their configured target SOP, so they cannot bypass trigger matching or the normal safety and audit path."
msgstr "所有通道投递在事件构建之前，都会先进入运行时共享的 SOP 入口适配器。该适配器负责源兴趣检查、必需的引擎/审计句柄诊断、不受信任输入的上限限制、事件时间戳以及分发结果日志记录。通道代码仅提供传输层拥有的主题和载荷。Forge 事件使用相同的边界及其配置的目标 SOP，因此它们无法绕过触发器匹配或正常的安全与审计路径。"

#: src/architecture/crates.md
msgid "All channels implement the `Channel` trait from `zeroclaw-api`. Each is feature-gated, a minimal build includes only the channels you compile in."
msgstr "所有通道均实现来自 `zeroclaw-api` 的 `Channel` trait。每个通道都受 feature 门控，最小化构建仅包含你编译时纳入的通道。"

