#: src/foundations/fnd-004-engineering-infrastructure.md
msgid "As the number of crates and artifact types grows, workflow duplication becomes a maintenance problem. GitHub Actions supports reusable workflows: a workflow that can be called from another workflow like a function. The build matrix, the security scan, and the test runner should each be extracted as reusable workflows."
