#: src/plugins/writing-a-tool-plugin.md
msgid "At registration, the host instantiates the component once to read `name`, `description`, and `parameters-schema`. These are cached; they are never re-asked. If that probe fails, registration fails; the host never substitutes synthetic metadata for a broken component."
msgstr "注册时，主机会实例化该组件一次，以读取 `name`、`description` 和 `parameters-schema`。这些信息会被缓存，之后不会再次请求。如果此次探测失败，注册也会失败；主机绝不会为出问题的组件替换为合成元数据。"

#: src/foundations/fnd-005-contribution-culture.md
msgid "At some point in this project you will be more experienced than someone else in a thread. Maybe you have been here longer. Maybe you happen to know the part of the codebase they are working in. Maybe you have seen this particular failure mode before."
msgstr "在这个项目的某个阶段，你可能会比线程中的其他人更有经验。也许你在这里的时间更长，也许你恰好了解他们正在处理的代码部分，也许你之前见过这种特定的故障模式。"

#: src/plugins/writing-a-tool-plugin.md
msgid "At startup, discovery finds your plugin directory, validates the manifest shape, runs signature policy, and then validates `config_schema`. Before registration, the host materializes the plugin's operator values to typed JSON and validates them. Survivors become `WasmTool` instances."
msgstr "启动时，发现机制会找到插件目录，验证清单结构，执行签名策略，然后验证 `config_schema`。注册之前，宿主会将插件的操作器值具体化为带类型的 JSON，并对其进行验证。通过验证的插件会成为 WasmTool 实例。"

#: src/foundations/fnd-006-zero-compromise-in-practice.md
msgid "At the floor, gates pass"
msgstr "在底部，门会传递"

#: src/maintainers/reviewer-playbook.md
msgid "At the follow-up date, re-check live state. If the author responded or the branch became reviewable, remove or keep off `stale-candidate`. If there is still no response and no maintainer takeover or replacement path, close with a backlog-hygiene rationale and a clear reopening or replacement path."
msgstr "在跟进日期，重新检查实时状态。如果作者已回复，或者该分支已变为可审查，则移除或继续保持 `stale-candidate` 不开启。如果仍无回复，且没有维护者接手或替代路径，则以 backlog 清理为由关闭，并提供明确的重新开启或替代路径。"

#: src/architecture/memory-payload-lifecycle.md
msgid "At turn start, the runtime can recall relevant memories and inject a bounded `[Memory context]` block into the user-visible prompt context. Related entry points do not all apply identical filters. The channel/interactive loop filters generated autosave noise, stale `<tool_result>` blocks, and Conversation entries when the turn has no safe session scope or is not user-initiated. Generic memory loading filters autosave noise and relevance, but does not by itself enforce that channel-loop Conversation exclusion."
msgstr "在回合开始时，运行时可以回忆相关记忆，并将一个有界的 `[Memory context]` 块注入到用户可见的提示上下文中。相关入口点并不都应用相同的过滤器。通道/交互循环会在该回合没有安全的会话作用域或不是用户发起时，过滤生成的自动保存噪声、过期的 `<tool_result>` 块以及 Conversation 条目。通用记忆加载会过滤自动保存噪声和相关性，但其本身并不强制执行通道循环的 Conversation 排除。"

