#: src/maintainers/ci-and-actions.md
msgid "Builds, signs, and scans the generated four-variant matrix from `dev/ci/docker-tags.toml`: `minimal`, `default-features`, `dist`, and `all-features`. A human-created `v*` tag starts this workflow directly. A stable release started with `workflow_dispatch` creates its tag with `GITHUB_TOKEN`, which does not emit another tag-push event, so `release-stable-manual.yml` calls Docker Publish synchronously at the immutable release tag after the canonical release and Docker jobs succeed."
msgstr "构建、签名并扫描从 `dev/ci/docker-tags.toml` 生成的四变体矩阵：`minimal`、`default-features`、`dist` 和 `all-features`。人工创建的 `v*` 标签会直接启动此工作流。通过 `workflow_dispatch` 启动的稳定版发布会使用 `GITHUB_TOKEN` 创建其标签，而这不会触发另一个标签推送事件，因此在规范发布和 Docker 作业成功后，`release-stable-manual.yml` 会在不可变的发布标签处同步调用 Docker Publish。"

