#: src/architecture/background-work-lifecycle.md
msgid "Cron combines declarative membership with a SQLite execution store. Runtime-created jobs and reconciled config jobs both carry an owning `agent_alias`; execution resolves that agent's security policy instead of running under an ambient daemon identity."
