msgid "Discord bot token (from Discord Developer Portal). `#[serde(default)]` for the same reason as `TelegramConfig::bot_token`: a missing token must deserialize as an empty string instead of salvage-dropping the alias; `validate_bot_token` still requires a real token once `enabled = true`."
