msgstr "将 issue 负载分派到 `issue-triage` SOP。"

#: src/channels/nextcloud-talk.md
msgid "Display name of the bot in Nextcloud Talk (e.g. \"zeroclaw\"). Used to filter out the bot's own messages and prevent feedback loops. If not set, defaults to an empty string (no self-message filtering by name)."
msgstr "机器人在 Nextcloud Talk 中显示的名称（例如 \"zeroclaw\"）。用于过滤掉机器人自己发送的消息，防止形成反馈循环。如果未设置，则默认为空字符串（不按名称过滤自身消息）。"

#: src/channels/line.md
msgid "Display name shown as the sender in LINE chat bubbles. Defaults to `\"AI\"` when unset or empty."
msgstr "在 LINE 聊天气泡中显示为发送者的显示名称。未设置或为空时默认为 `\"AI\"`。"

#: src/tools/mcp.md
msgid "Display name used as a tool prefix (`<server>__<tool>`). Filled in from the supplied `map_key` when the entry is created via `create_map_key(\"mcp.servers\", \"<name>\")`; `#[serde(default)]` lets the macro default-construct from `{}` before the name gets injected."
msgstr "用作工具前缀的显示名称（`<server>__<tool>`）。当通过 `create_map_key(\"mcp.servers\", \"<name>\")` 创建条目时，会从提供的 `map_key` 填充；`#[serde(default)]` 让宏在名称注入之前先从 `{}` 默认构造。"

#: src/plugins/writing-a-memory-plugin.md
msgid "Display name versus raw storage identifier. Use `agent-id` for scope equality checks, `agent-alias` for display."
msgstr "显示名称与原始存储标识符。使用 `agent-id` 进行作用域相等性检查，使用 `agent-alias` 进行显示。"

