#: src/foundations/fnd-003-governance.md
msgid "During development, an AI assistant equipped with the RFC and the crate's AGENTS.md can help a contributor understand which crate a new piece of functionality belongs in before they write it, flag a potential dependency inversion while the code is still being shaped, explain why a design pattern exists, and suggest whether a new abstraction is at the right layer. This is additive. It makes contributors more capable."
msgstr "在开发过程中，配备 RFC 和 crate 的 AGENTS.md 的 AI 助手可以帮助贡献者在编写代码之前理解新的功能属于哪个 crate，在代码结构仍在塑造时标记潜在的依赖倒置问题，解释设计模式存在的原因，并建议新的抽象是否处于正确的层级。这是增量的，它使贡献者更加有能力。"

