#: src/providers/routing.md
msgid "Effective execution can differ after a rate limit: entries from one profile share a cooldown key, so a `429` on the primary can skip that profile's remaining fallback models while the cooldown is active."
msgstr "触发速率限制后，实际执行情况可能有所不同：同一配置文件中的条目共享一个冷却键，因此主模型收到 `429` 后，在冷却期间可能会跳过该配置文件中其余的备用模型。"

#: src/plugins/index.md
msgid "Effective grants are checked separately from manifest requests. If `config_read` is denied, the host validates an empty object: an all-optional schema receives `{}` (and a tool omits the empty `__config` key), while required properties make startup fail closed. The canonical host field list and defaults are in the [Config reference](../reference/config.md); `zeroclaw config list` shows the live stored values."
msgstr "有效授权与清单请求分开检查。如果 `config_read` 被拒绝，宿主会验证一个空对象：全为可选属性的架构会收到 `{}`（工具会省略空的 `__config` 键），而包含必需属性的架构会使启动失败并默认拒绝。宿主的规范字段列表和默认值位于[配置参考](../reference/config.md)中；`zeroclaw config list` 会显示当前存储的值。"

#: src/plugins/migrating-to-typed-config.md
msgid "Effective grants are checked separately from manifest requests. When `config_read` is requested but not granted, the host validates an empty object against your schema:"
msgstr "最终授予的权限会与清单请求分开检查。当请求 `config_read` 但未获授予时，宿主会根据你的架构验证一个空对象："

#: src/architecture/rpc-socket.md
msgid "Either side may send a request on the established socket. The receiver must answer with the same `id` and exactly one of `result` or `error`. Each peer uses its own `zc-out-<number>` sequence for outbound requests; the prefix is not a globally unique namespace. Correlation remains directional: each peer matches responses only against its own pending-request map, so the same textual ID can be in flight independently in opposite directions."
msgstr "任一方都可以通过已建立的套接字发送请求。接收方必须使用相同的 `id` 进行响应，并且只能包含 `result` 或 `error` 二者之一。每个对等方都使用各自的 `zc-out-<number>` 序列发送出站请求；此前缀不是全局唯一的命名空间。关联仍然具有方向性：每个对等方仅根据自己的待处理请求映射匹配响应，因此相同的文本 ID 可以在相反方向上独立处于进行中状态。"

