msgstr "示例：zeroclaw cron add-at --agent morning-shift --prompt 2099-01-15T14:00:00Z 'Send reminder' zeroclaw cron add-at --agent morning-shift --prompt 2099-12-31T23:59:00Z 'Happy New Year!'"

