msgstr "Extism 调用是同步的，而 ZeroClaw 的 `Tool` trait 是异步的，因此调用使用了阻塞任务桥接。"

#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-009-wit-wasmtime-plugin-execution.md
msgid "Extism was a useful bootstrap for proving that external WASM plugins could appear as ZeroClaw tools. It also gave the project a simple JSON protocol and a permission-gated host-function model."
msgstr "Extism 对于证明外部 WASM 插件可以作为 ZeroClaw 工具出现很有帮助。它也为该项目提供了一个简单的 JSON 协议和一个由权限门控的主机函数模型。"

#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-003-wasm-plugin-model.md
msgid "Extism's built-in HTTP support was deliberately not used because it would bypass ZeroClaw's permission enforcement."
msgstr "之所以刻意不使用 Extism 内置的 HTTP 支持，是因为它会绕过 ZeroClaw 的权限强制执行。"

#: src/reference/config.md
