#: src/providers/catalog.md
msgid "Extra environment variable names inherited by the `grok` subprocess. Values are resolved from the ZeroClaw process environment at spawn time. The default is empty so unrelated daemon secrets remain blocked. `XAI_API_KEY` is the sole supported provider-owned name and enables API-key authentication when explicitly listed and non-empty; other `XAI_*` and all `GROK_*` names are rejected."
msgstr "`grok` 子进程继承的额外环境变量名称。值会在生成子进程时从 ZeroClaw 进程环境中解析。默认值为空，因此无关的守护进程机密仍会被阻止传递。`XAI_API_KEY` 是唯一受支持的提供商自有名称，只有在明确列出且值非空时才会启用 API 密钥身份验证；其他 `XAI_*` 和所有 `GROK_*` 名称都会被拒绝。"

#: src/providers/catalog.md
msgid "Extra global Grok long flags inserted before `agent stdio`. Known options may put their value in the next token; other value-taking options use `--flag=value`. Positional and short arguments are rejected. ZeroClaw defaults to `--sandbox strict`, `--permission-mode dontAsk`, and an empty built-in tool set. Providing the corresponding flags here is an explicit per-alias opt-in to relax those defaults. ACP transport, prompt/model/session, cwd, debug-file, and update-policy flags are reserved."
msgstr "在 `agent stdio` 之前插入的额外全局 Grok 长选项。已知选项可以将其值放在下一个令牌中；其他需要取值的选项使用 `--flag=value`。不接受位置参数和短参数。ZeroClaw 默认使用 `--sandbox strict`、`--permission-mode dontAsk`，并使用空的内置工具集。在此处提供相应标志，表示按别名显式选择放宽这些默认设置。ACP 传输、提示词/模型/会话、cwd、调试文件和更新策略标志属于保留项。"

#: src/reference/config.md
msgid "Extra openvpn CLI arguments forwarded verbatim."
msgstr "额外的 openvpn CLI 参数，按原样转发。"

