#: src/providers/openai-codex-subscription.md
msgid "Importing the token"
msgstr "导入令牌"

#: src/channels/whatsapp.md
msgid "In **Cloud API mode**, neither check is applied. Its pending entry is a bare responder keyed by the token, with no chat and no identity recorded alongside it, so the webhook treats possession of the token as authority. In a group that means any member who can read the prompt can answer it, including from a different chat. Until that path is hardened, a Cloud-mode approval is proof that someone possessed the token and nothing more. It authenticates neither the chat nor the responder, so prefer Web mode wherever either matters."
msgstr "在 **Cloud API 模式**下，这两项检查都不会应用。其待处理条目只是一个以令牌为键的裸响应者，其中没有同时记录聊天会话或身份信息，因此 webhook 将持有令牌视为授权。在群组中，这意味着任何能读到提示的成员都可以回答，包括从不同的聊天会话中回答。在该路径得到加固之前，Cloud 模式下的批准只能证明有人持有过令牌，除此之外别无他物。它既不会验证聊天会话，也不会验证响应者的身份，因此只要聊天会话或响应者身份有任何一项重要，就应优先使用 Web 模式。"

#: src/channels/whatsapp.md
msgid "In **Web mode**, a reply is honoured only when it comes from the same chat the prompt was posted into **and** from a peer this alias is authorized to take instructions from. A reply that fails either check is logged and ignored, and the request stays open so the operator can still answer it. In a group the prompt says so, because otherwise there is no way to tell why a bystander's reply did nothing."
msgstr "在 **Web 模式**下，只有当回复来自发布提示的同一聊天，并且来自此别名获授权接受其指令的对端时，才会被采纳。未通过任一检查的回复都会被记录并忽略，请求仍会保持打开状态，以便操作员仍可回答。在群聊中，提示会说明这一点，因为否则无法判断旁观者的回复为何没有产生作用。"

#: src/channels/mattermost.md
msgid "In Mattermost: **System Console → Integrations → Bot Accounts → Add Bot Account**. Set a username (e.g. `zeroclaw`), enable the scopes you want."
msgstr "在 Mattermost 中：**系统控制台 → 集成 → 机器人账号 → 添加机器人账号**。设置用户名（例如 `zeroclaw`），并启用你需要的权限范围。"

