msgid "Keep the ZeroClaw default `--sandbox strict` (or an explicit `workspace` profile) and grant only the actual Grok executable permission to create a user namespace. This is a host-administrator change; it preserves the global user namespace restriction and does not turn off Grok's sandbox."
msgstr "保留 ZeroClaw 默认的 `--sandbox strict`（或显式的 `workspace` 配置文件），并仅授予实际的 Grok 可执行文件创建用户命名空间的权限。这是主机管理员执行的更改；它保留了全局用户命名空间限制，不会关闭 Grok 的沙箱。"

#: src/setup/freebsd.md
msgid "Keep the `--os linux --arch amd64` flags on every `run` (not just `pull`) so Podman doesn't re-resolve to the FreeBSD default."
msgstr "在每个 `run` 命令（而不仅仅是 `pull`）上保留 `--os linux --arch amd64` 标志，以便 Podman 不会重新解析为 FreeBSD 默认值。"

