#: src/ops/observability.md
msgid "Memory operations outside a correlated turn keep producing root spans: the gateway REST memory store, and the `process_message` hardware-RAG retrieval, which runs before the turn bracket opens and therefore stays a root span carrying the matching `zeroclaw.turn_id` attribute (full nesting of that span is tracked in #8844). A `turn_id` that no longer matches a live turn also degrades to a root span rather than guessing a parent."
msgstr "在关联的 turn 之外进行的内存操作会持续产生根 span：网关 REST 内存存储，以及 `process_message` 硬件 RAG 检索——后者在 turn 括号开启之前运行，因此仍是一个带有匹配 `zeroclaw.turn_id` 属性的根 span（该 span 的完整嵌套在 #8844 中跟踪）。不再匹配活跃 turn 的 `turn_id` 也会降级为根 span，而不是猜测其父级。"

#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-005-pluggable-memory-backends.md
msgid "Memory persistence is selected through a backend-neutral contract, with SQLite as the default backend."
msgstr "内存持久化通过与后端无关的契约进行选择，默认后端为 SQLite。"

