msgid "On success the gateway returns `{ \"paired\": true, \"token\": \"<bearer>\" }`. The bridge stores the token for subsequent authenticated requests."
msgstr "成功后，网关会返回 `{ \"paired\": true, \"token\": \"<bearer>\" }`。桥接器会存储该令牌，以用于后续经过身份验证的请求。"

#: src/channels/telegram.md
msgid "On success, ZeroClaw prefers the stable numeric sender ID, adds it to `[peer_groups.telegram_home]` for `telegram.home`, and saves `config.toml`. The running channel's peer resolver reads that shared config, so the user can send the next message immediately without a restart."
msgstr "成功后，ZeroClaw 会优先使用稳定的数字发送者 ID，将其添加到 `[peer_groups.telegram_home]` 以供 `telegram.home` 使用，并保存 `config.toml`。正在运行的通道的对等方解析器会读取该共享配置，因此用户可以立即发送下一条消息，无需重启。"

#: src/agents/delegation.md
msgid "On success, the tool's output IS the child's final response text. If the child returned an empty string, the output is the literal placeholder: `subagent completed without output`. There is no fixed prefix to grep for in the success case."
msgstr "工具成功执行后，其输出即为子代理的最终响应文本。如果子代理返回空字符串，则输出为字面占位符：`subagent completed without output`。成功情况下没有固定的前缀可供 grep 检索。"

