#: src/channels/slack.md
msgid "One hydration makes at most three total `conversations.replies` attempts, including retries after HTTP 429 responses. ZeroClaw honors Slack's `Retry-After` value before retrying while request budget remains. If a longer thread still has another page, ZeroClaw uses the bounded partial context, adds an omission marker, and records the thread as hydrated so later replies do not restart the scan. A Slack API failure does not drop the current message; it skips hydration and releases the reservation so the next eligible reply can retry."
msgstr "一次补全最多进行三次 `conversations.replies` 尝试，包括 HTTP 429 响应后的重试。只要请求预算尚有余量，ZeroClaw 就会遵循 Slack 的 `Retry-After` 值，然后再进行重试。如果较长的线程仍有下一页，ZeroClaw 会使用受限的部分上下文，添加省略标记，并将该线程记录为已补全，以便后续回复不会重新开始扫描。Slack API 失败不会丢弃当前消息；系统会跳过补全并释放预留，以便下一个符合条件的回复可以重试。"

