#: src/plugins/index.md
msgid "Per-instance settings live under `plugins.entries`, keyed by a versioned `zpi1_…` string derived from the host-owned package, capability, and binding identity. Installation prints and seeds the keys for the package's default tool binding; `zeroclaw plugin info <package>` prints that tool key again. Those automatic surfaces are tool-only. Alias-owned channel construction must derive, display, and seed the key from its actual configured alias rather than inventing a package-name binding. That production path is not present in this slice; it is tracked in [\\#8852](https://github.com/zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw/pull/8852), or its accepted successor. Full-identity keys let different packages and capability worlds safely reuse aliases such as `main` without sharing credentials. The canonical operator values are a secret-marked string map and remain encrypted at rest (`enc2:…`). A plugin that requests `config_read` declares the map's single type contract in `config_schema`: a closed Draft 2020-12 object whose top-level properties explicitly use `string`, `boolean`, `integer`, `number`, `array`, or `object`. Store strings directly, JSON scalar text for booleans and numbers, and JSON text for arrays and objects. The host materializes and validates the resulting typed object before instantiating tool or channel guest code; unknown, malformed, or out-of-range values fail instead of reaching the plugin. Memory plugins do not yet have a config export and must not request `config_read` until that ABI is added."
msgstr "每个实例的设置位于 `plugins.entries` 下，并以一个带版本的 `zpi1_…` 字符串作为键；该字符串由主机拥有的包、能力和绑定标识派生而来。安装时会为该包的默认工具绑定打印并预置这些键；`zeroclaw plugin info <package>` 会再次打印该工具键。这些自动提供的入口仅限工具使用。由别名拥有的通道构造必须根据其实际配置的别名来派生、显示并预置该键，而不是凭空创建一个包名绑定。这条生产路径在当前代码切片中尚不存在；相关工作已在 [\\#8852](https://github.com/zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw/pull/8852) 中跟踪，或由其获接受的后续方案承接。完整身份键使不同的包和能力世界能够安全地复用 `main` 等别名，而不会共享凭据。规范的操作员值是一个带机密标记的字符串映射，并在静态存储时保持加密状态（`enc2:…`）。请求 `config_read` 的插件会在 `config_schema` 中声明该映射的单一类型契约：一个封闭的 Draft 2020-12 对象，其顶层属性明确使用 `string`、`boolean`、`integer`、`number`、`array` 或 `object`。字符串直接存储，布尔值和数字存储为 JSON 标量文本，数组和对象存储为 JSON 文本。主机在实例化工具或通道来宾代码之前，会将结果具体化为类型化对象并进行验证；未知、格式错误或超出范围的值会被拒绝，而不会传递给插件。Memory 插件尚未提供配置导出，因此在添加该 ABI 之前不得请求 `config_read`。"

