#: src/sop/how-it-works.md
msgid "Run state and audit history are separate surfaces. See [Background work lifecycle](../architecture/background-work-lifecycle.md) for lifecycle ownership, cancellation, and restart semantics."
msgstr "运行状态和审计历史属于不同界面。有关生命周期归属、取消和重启语义，请参阅[后台工作生命周期](../architecture/background-work-lifecycle.md)。"

#: src/sop/how-it-works.md
msgid "Run state is process-local by default. With `sop.persist_runs = true`, successful initialization of the default SQLite backend stores it under `<data_dir>/sop/runs.db` and restores active runs after restart. Initialization failure logs a warning and falls back to process-local memory."
msgstr "运行状态默认是进程本地的。使用 `sop.persist_runs = true` 时，默认 SQLite 后端成功初始化后，会将其存储在 `<data_dir>/sop/runs.db` 下，并在重启后恢复活跃运行。初始化失败会记录警告，并回退到进程本地内存。"

