#: src/architecture/logging.md
msgid "Sends the structured event to current in-process subscribers. A subscriber only sees events emitted after it subscribes, bounded receivers can lag, and the gateway SSE adapter skips lagged frames. Broadcast-only ephemeral attributes may appear in an authenticated live frame but are excluded from persisted JSONL. This is a live notification path, not replayable evidence."
msgstr "将结构化事件发送给当前进程内的订阅者。订阅者只能看到其订阅后发出的事件，有界接收器可能会滞后，网关 SSE 适配器会跳过滞后的帧。仅用于广播的临时属性可能出现在经过身份验证的实时帧中，但不会包含在持久化的 JSONL 中。这是一条实时通知路径，而不是可重放的证据。"

