#: src/foundations/fnd-001-intentional-architecture.md
msgid "Stability tiers are **promoted, never demoted** through a deliberate team decision. Promotions are recorded in the changelog and, for architectural components, in an ADR. A component must hold its current tier for at least one full release cycle before promotion is considered."
