#: src/architecture/localization-catalog-lifecycle.md
msgid "Storage and loading are separate concerns:"
msgstr "存储和加载是相互独立的关注点："

#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-005-pluggable-memory-backends.md
msgid "Storage backends do not own prompt construction or turn policy. The turn engine owns memory-context selection and rendering. `MemoryStrategy` is the designated boundary for consolidation and governance above a `Memory` handle, but migration to that boundary is not complete: some paths still call lower-level lifecycle functions directly. Issue #6850 tracks the remaining alignment. Backend implementations provide storage and retrieval behavior without becoming the long-term owner of those lifecycle rules."
msgstr "存储后端不拥有提示词构建或轮次策略。轮次引擎拥有记忆上下文的选择与渲染。`MemoryStrategy` 是 `Memory` 句柄之上用于整合与治理的指定边界，但向该边界的迁移尚未完成：部分路径仍直接调用底层生命周期函数。Issue #6850 跟踪剩余的对齐工作。后端实现提供存储与检索行为，但不会成为这些生命周期规则的长期所有者。"

#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-005-pluggable-memory-backends.md
msgid "Storage contract"
msgstr "存储契约"

#: src/reference/config.md
msgid "Storage is a two-tier alias-keyed map: `[storage.<backend>.<alias>]`, parallel to `[providers.models.<type>.<alias>]`. Each backend has its own typed config struct. `MemoryConfig.backend` carries a dotted reference (`\"sqlite.default\"`, `\"postgres.work\"`) that resolves to one of these entries via \\[`Config::resolve_active_storage`\\]."
msgstr "Storage 是一个两级别名键控映射：`[storage.<backend>.<alias>]`，与 `[providers.models.<type>.<alias>]` 平行。每个后端都有自己的类型化配置结构体。`MemoryConfig.backend` 携带一个带点的引用（`\"sqlite.default\"`、`\"postgres.work\"`），它通过 \\[`Config::resolve_active_storage`\\] 解析为这些条目之一。"

#: src/plugins/writing-a-memory-plugin.md
msgid "Store `(key, content, category, session-id)`. Named `store-entry` because `store` is reserved in wit-bindgen."
msgstr "存储 `(key, content, category, session-id)`。之所以命名为 `store-entry`，是因为 `store` 在 wit-bindgen 中是保留字。"

#: src/tools/overview.md
msgid "Store a fact, preference, or note in long-term memory"
msgstr "将事实、偏好或备注存储到长期记忆中"

#: src/architecture/runtime-state-and-persistence.md
msgid "Store initialization failure logs a warning and falls back to memory. Memory-backed audit records are not the run-lifecycle source of truth."
msgstr "存储初始化失败会记录一条警告，并回退到内存。以内存为后端的审计记录不是运行生命周期的事实来源。"

#: src/plugins/index.md
msgid "Store lifecycle"
msgstr "存储生命周期"

#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-009-wit-wasmtime-plugin-execution.md
msgid "Store limits, fuel, table limits, instance limits, and memory ceilings are resolved before the store is built."
msgstr "在构建 store 之前，会解析 store limits、fuel、table limits、instance limits 和 memory ceilings。"

#: src/reference/config.md
msgid "Stored alias-keyed on `Config.cron`. The map key serves as the stable job id. Synced into the database at scheduler startup with `source = \"declarative\"`, distinguishing them from jobs created imperatively via CLI or API. Declarative config takes precedence on each sync: if the config changes, the DB is updated to match. Imperative jobs are never deleted by sync."
msgstr "存储在 `Config.cron` 中，以别名作为键。该 map 键充当稳定的作业 id。在调度器启动时同步到数据库，`source = \"declarative\"`，以将它们与通过 CLI 或 API 以命令式方式创建的作业区分开来。声明式配置在每次同步时优先：如果配置发生变化，数据库会更新以保持一致。命令式作业绝不会被同步删除。"

#: src/architecture/memory-payload-lifecycle.md
msgid "Stores and recalls must stay agent-scoped. A tool result, log line, or session row is not long-term memory unless a memory write happened."
msgstr "存储和回忆必须保持 agent 作用域。工具结果、日志行或会话行并不构成长期记忆，除非发生了 memory write。"

