#: src/philosophy/you-own-it.md
msgid "The binary runs on your machine, your VPS, or your SBC. Your API keys live in your config file. Your conversation history lives in your database. No telemetry, no cloud tenancy, no license server. If you pull the power cord, the agent stops, and nothing else breaks."
msgstr "该二进制文件运行在你的机器、你的 VPS 或你的 SBC 上。你的 API 密钥保存在你的配置文件中。你的对话历史保存在你的数据库里。没有遥测，没有云端租户，没有许可证服务器。如果你拔掉电源线，agent 会停止运行，而其他任何东西都不会出问题。"

#: src/foundations/fnd-003-governance.md
msgid "The block below is the original illustrative proposal, kept for the reasoning it shows about routing by risk tier. It is not the current file and should not be copied. `.github/CODEOWNERS` already exists and is actively maintained; it routes to individual handles rather than team handles, and its paths follow the post-microkernel crate layout established in #6537. The `@zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw-core` and `@zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw-contributors` handles used here were never created; see §5.3. Read the live file for current routing."
msgstr "下方的代码块是原始的说明性提案，保留它是为了展示其中关于按风险等级进行路由的推理过程。它不是当前文件，不应被复制。`.github/CODEOWNERS` 已经存在并处于积极维护状态；它路由到的是各个个人 handle 而非团队 handle，且其路径遵循 #6537 中确立的微内核后 crate 布局。此处使用的 `@zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw-core` 和 `@zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw-contributors` handle 从未被创建；参见 §5.3。请阅读实时文件以获取当前的路由信息。"

