#: src/architecture/logging.md
msgid "The central tool executor (`crates/zeroclaw-runtime/src/agent/tool_execution.rs::execute_one_tool`) wraps every `Tool::execute(args)` call with invoke/complete/fail events. Each event's name is `module_path!()` (the executor's own module), not a hardcoded string; the `Action` and severity distinguish them:"
