#: src/plugins/writing-a-channel-plugin.md
msgid "The operator still stores `timeout_secs` as the encrypted string `\"10\"`; the host turns it into the JSON integer `10` and enforces the range before `configure` runs. Arrays and objects use JSON text in operator storage and arrive as real arrays and objects. Because `api_token` is required, withholding `config_read` fails closed instead of starting a channel with no credentials. Each channel instance selects the `plugins.entries` key derived from its full package, `channel` capability, and binding identity while reusing this one package-owned schema. Identical aliases in different packages therefore remain isolated. The install and info commands cannot create this key because they do not own the configured channel alias; their automatic print and seed behavior is tool-only. Alias-aware channel key display and seeding is tracked in [\\#8852](https://github.com/zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw/pull/8852), or its accepted successor. Prepare the manifest and guest now, but do not publish a channel-only package as migrated to typed config until that production path exists."
msgstr "操作端仍将 `timeout_secs` 存储为加密字符串 `\"10\"`；宿主端会将其转换为 JSON 整数 `10`，并在 `configure` 运行前强制执行范围限制。数组和对象在操作端存储时使用 JSON 文本，传入时则是真实的数组和对象。由于 `api_token` 是必需项，不提供 `config_read` 会默认拒绝，而不是在没有凭据的情况下启动通道。每个通道实例都会选择一个由其完整包名、`channel` 能力和绑定标识派生出的 `plugins.entries` 键，同时复用同一份包自有的配置模式。因此，不同包中的相同别名仍彼此隔离。install 和 info 命令无法创建此键，因为它们并不拥有已配置的通道别名；它们自动打印和初始化的行为仅供工具使用。支持别名的通道键显示和初始化工作记录在 [\\#8852](https://github.com/zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw/pull/8852) 中，或记录在其获接受的后续项中。现在准备清单和来宾端，但在该生产路径存在之前，不要将仅通道包以已迁移至类型化配置的状态发布。"

#: src/developing/plugin-protocol.md
msgid "The operator's canonical `plugins.entries.<instance-key>.config` values remain a secret-marked string map in memory and are encrypted when persisted. The host derives the versioned `zpi1_…` entry key from the full package, capability, and binding identity; this lets different packages and capability worlds safely reuse aliases such as `main`. The admitted package manifest selects the schema. A `string` value is stored directly; `boolean`, `integer`, and `number` values use JSON scalar text such as `\"true\"`, `\"4\"`, or `\"0.5\"`; `array` and `object` values use JSON text such as `'[\"urgent\",\"ops\"]'` or `'{\"region\":\"us-east\"}'`. The host materializes and validates that data into typed JSON for each use. For a tool, it injects the result under the reserved `__config` key:"
msgstr "运算方的规范 `plugins.entries.<instance-key>.config` 值在内存中仍是带 `secret` 标记的字符串映射，并且在持久化时会加密。主机根据完整的软件包、能力和绑定标识派生版本化的 `zpi1_…` 条目键；这样，不同的软件包和能力域就可以安全地重复使用 `main` 之类的别名。获准的软件包清单会选择架构。`string` 值直接存储；`boolean`、`integer` 和 `number` 值使用 JSON 标量文本，例如 `\"true\"`、`\"4\"` 或 `\"0.5\"`；`array` 和 `object` 值使用 JSON 文本，例如 `'[\"urgent\",\"ops\"]'` 或 `'{\"region\":\"us-east\"}'`。主机会在每次使用时将这些数据具体化并验证为类型化 JSON。对于工具，它会将结果注入保留的 `__config` 键下："

