msgid "The root `AGENTS.md` sets the compact project-wide policy. The [architecture and contribution map](../contributing/architecture-map.md) routes tasks to maintained architecture, foundation, testing, security, and maintainer sources. [Coding agent guidelines](../contributing/agent-guidelines.md) provide detailed project-wide examples and registries that are useful on demand but are not part of the always-loaded bootstrap."
