#: src/architecture/runtime-state-and-persistence.md
msgid "The single-source-of-truth rule still applies: if a fact already lives in one surface, do not copy it into another stored field. Store new state only when this table identifies the owning surface, or resolve it from the canonical owner at use time."
msgstr "单一事实来源规则仍然适用：如果某个事实已经存在于某个界面中，就不要将其复制到另一个存储字段中。只有当此表标识了拥有该界面时，才存储新状态；否则在使用时从规范拥有者处解析它。"

