msgid "The tool calls `SubAgentSpawn::for_agent` + `build`. Failures (unknown parent alias, escalating override) surface as `ToolResult { success: false, error: \"subagent spawn failed: ...\" }`."
msgstr "该工具调用 `SubAgentSpawn::for_agent` + `build`。失败情况（未知的父级别名、升级覆盖）会以 `ToolResult { success: false, error: \"subagent spawn failed: ...\" }` 的形式呈现。"

#: src/agents/delegation.md
