#: src/foundations/fnd-003-governance.md
msgid "There is a concept in software teams of work that is \"done\" but not \"done done.\" Done means the code is written. Done done means it is tested, documented, reviewed, merged, and released. The Definition of Done above describes done done. Nothing should be called done until it meets the full definition."
msgstr "在软件团队中，存在一种“已完成”但并非“完全完成”的工作概念。“已完成”仅表示代码已编写完毕，而“完全完成”则意味着代码已经过测试、文档化、审查、合并并正式发布。上述的“完成定义”描述的就是“完全完成”的状态。只有满足完整定义的工作，才能被称为“已完成”。"

