#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-009-wit-wasmtime-plugin-execution.md
msgid "This ADR supersedes [ADR-003](./ADR-003-wasm-plugin-model.md). ADR-003 recorded the initial Extism bridge. The current accepted architecture is a WIT-defined WASM Component Model surface hosted directly by `wasmtime`."
msgstr "此 ADR 取代 [ADR-003](./ADR-003-wasm-plugin-model.md)。ADR-003 记录了最初的 Extism 桥接。当前已接受的架构是一个由 WIT 定义、由 `wasmtime` 直接承载的 WASM 组件模型接口。"

