#: src/architecture/background-work-lifecycle.md
msgid "Under a booted daemon, delegate and subagent producers also write task rows to the durable control plane. These writes are best-effort and independent from delegate result-file writes. Delegate result reads remain file-first; only a file still marked `running` is overlaid as `lost` or `timed_out` from control-plane state, so the two records can diverge."
msgstr "在已启动的守护进程下，delegate 和 subagent 生产者也会将任务行写入持久化控制平面。这些写入采用尽力而为方式，并且独立于 delegate 结果文件的写入。delegate 结果读取仍然以文件优先；只有仍标记为 `running` 的文件，才会根据控制平面状态叠加为 `lost` 或 `timed_out`，因此这两条记录可能会出现分歧。"

