#: src/contributing/agent-policy-parity-harness.md
msgid "Until a surface has a single resolution seam, there is nothing to assert parity against, so its row stays in the divergence record as an always-running divergence characterization rather than as a premature green test - never as an `#[ignore]`d spec, consistent with the no-ignored-specs rule above."
msgstr "在一个曲面只有单一分辨率接缝之前，没有任何可用于断言 parity 的对象，因此其行会保留在 divergence 记录中，作为一个始终运行的 divergence 特征描述，而不是一个过早通过的 green test - 绝不会作为一个 `#[ignore]`d spec，与上面的 no-ignored-specs 规则一致。"

