msgid "Use cases"
msgstr "用例"

#: src/reference/config.md
msgid "Use compact bootstrap (6000 chars / 2 RAG chunks). `None` inherits."
msgstr "使用紧凑型 bootstrap（6000 字符 / 2 个 RAG chunk）。`None` 继承。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "Use dot-separated segments. Array elements use a numeric segment such as `$.readings.1`; bracket syntax is not supported."
msgstr "使用以点号分隔的段。数组元素使用数字段，例如 `$.readings.1`；不支持方括号语法。"

