msgstr "当审查需求超过容量时："

#: src/architecture/config-lifecycle.md
msgid "When reviewing a PR that touches a schema-visible but not yet runtime-consumed field, require the PR description to say whether runtime wiring is deferred, out of scope, or completed by the same change."
msgstr "在审查一个涉及 schema 可见但尚未被运行时消费的字段的 PR 时，要求 PR 描述说明运行时接线是延后、超出范围，还是由同一项更改完成。"

#: src/architecture/config-lifecycle.md
msgid "When reviewing a config write, check that:"
msgstr "在审查 config 写入时，请检查："

