#: src/channels/line.md
msgid "When transcription is enabled (via the global `[transcription]` config, see [Config reference](../reference/config.md)), LINE `audio` message events are automatically downloaded from the LINE Content API and transcribed before being passed to the model."
msgstr "启用转录功能后（通过全局 `[transcription]` 配置，参见[配置参考](../reference/config.md)），LINE 的 `audio` 消息事件会自动从 LINE Content API 下载并转录，然后再传递给模型。"

#: src/channels/slack.md
msgid "When true (and `mention_only` is also true), messages inside a Slack thread must also @-mention the bot to trigger a response. By default, thread replies are allowed through without a mention so the bot can keep a back-and-forth going without the user repeating @-mentions. Set this to true in channels shared with human discussion where the bot should stay silent unless explicitly addressed."
msgstr "当为 true 时（且 `mention_only` 也为 true），Slack 线程内的消息也必须 @ 提及该机器人才能触发响应。默认情况下，线程回复无需提及即可放行，以便机器人能够持续进行来回对话，而无需用户反复 @ 提及。在与人工讨论共享的频道中，若希望机器人在未被明确呼叫时保持沉默，请将此项设为 true。"

#: src/channels/mattermost.md
msgid "When true (default), auto-discovery includes DM (`type=D`) and group DM (`type=G`) channels. Set false to restrict the bot to public and private team channels only. Has no effect when `channel_ids` lists explicit IDs. Defaults to `true` at the call site via `discover_dms.unwrap_or(true)`."
msgstr "当为 true（默认值）时，自动发现包括私信（`type=D`）和群组私信（`type=G`）频道。设为 false 可将该机器人限制为仅访问公开和私有团队频道。当 `channel_ids` 中列出了明确的 ID 时，此项无效。在调用处通过 `discover_dms.unwrap_or(true)` 默认为 `true`。"

#: src/channels/matrix.md
msgid "When true (default), replies are sent as thread replies. Starts a new thread from the incoming message when none exists. When false, only continues existing threads."
msgstr "为 true（默认值）时，回复将以话题回复的形式发送。如果尚不存在话题，则从传入消息开始新的话题。为 false 时，仅继续现有话题。"

#: src/channels/slack.md
msgid "When true (default), replies stay in the originating Slack thread. When false, replies go to the channel root instead."
msgstr "为 true 时（默认），回复将保留在原始的 Slack 线程中。为 false 时，回复将改为发送到频道根目录。"

#: src/channels/mattermost.md
msgid "When true (default), replies thread on the original post. When false, replies go to the channel root."
msgstr "为 true 时（默认），回复以原帖为线程展开。为 false 时，回复将发送到频道根目录。"

#: src/channels/whatsapp.md
msgid "When true and mode = \"personal\", always respond to messages in the user's own self-chat (Notes to Self). Defaults to false."
msgstr "当设为 true 且 mode = \"personal\" 时，始终在用户自己的私聊（Notes to Self）中回复消息。默认为 false。"

#: src/channels/whatsapp.md
msgid "When true in WhatsApp Web group chats, unaddressed messages that pass sender/chat authorization are recorded as passive conversation context without starting an agent turn. Default: `false`."
msgstr "当在 WhatsApp Web 群聊中设为 true 时，未被指向、且通过发送者/聊天授权的消息会被记录为被动对话上下文，而不会启动一次代理轮次。默认值：`false`。"

#: src/channels/discord.md
msgid "When true, a newer Discord message from the same sender in the same channel cancels the in-flight request and starts a fresh response with preserved history."
msgstr "为 true 时，来自同一频道中同一发送者的较新 Discord 消息会取消正在处理的请求，并在保留历史记录的情况下重新开始响应。"

#: src/channels/mattermost.md
msgid "When true, a newer Mattermost message from the same sender in the same channel cancels the in-flight request and starts a fresh response with preserved history."
msgstr "为 true 时，来自同一频道中同一发送者的较新 Mattermost 消息会取消正在处理的请求，并在保留历史记录的情况下重新开始响应。"

#: src/channels/slack.md
msgid "When true, a newer Slack message from the same sender in the same channel cancels the in-flight request and starts a fresh response with preserved history."
msgstr "当设为 true 时，来自同一发送者在同一频道中的较新 Slack 消息会取消正在处理的请求，并在保留历史记录的情况下重新开始生成响应。"

#: src/channels/telegram.md
msgid "When true, a newer Telegram message from the same sender in the same chat cancels the in-flight request and starts a fresh response with preserved history."
msgstr "当设为 true 时，来自同一聊天中同一发送者的较新 Telegram 消息将取消正在处理的请求，并在保留历史记录的情况下开始一个新的响应。"

#: src/channels/signal.md
msgid "When true, only accept direct messages and ignore all group traffic. Mutually exclusive with `group_ids` (which is ignored when this is set). Migrated from the legacy `group_id = \"dm\"` sentinel."
msgstr "为 true 时，仅接受直接消息并忽略所有群组流量。与 `group_ids` 互斥（设置此项时将忽略 `group_ids`）。从旧版 `group_id = \"dm\"` 标记迁移而来。"

#: src/channels/whatsapp.md
msgid "When true, only respond to messages that @-mention the bot in groups (Web mode only). Direct messages are always processed. Bot identity is resolved from the wa-rs device at runtime; `pair_phone` seeds it on first connect."
msgstr "为 true 时，在群组中仅响应 @ 提及该 bot 的消息（仅限 Web 模式）。私信始终会被处理。Bot 身份在运行时从 wa-rs 设备解析；首次连接时由 `pair_phone` 进行初始化。"

#: src/channels/matrix.md src/channels/telegram.md
msgid "When true, only respond to messages that @-mention the bot in groups. Direct messages are always processed."
msgstr "为 true 时，在群组中仅响应 @ 提及该机器人的消息。私信始终会被处理。"

#: src/channels/slack.md
msgid "When true, only respond to messages that @-mention the bot in groups. Direct messages remain allowed."
msgstr "为 true 时，在群组中仅响应 @ 提及该机器人的消息。私信仍然允许。"

#: src/channels/mattermost.md
msgid "When true, only respond to messages that @-mention the bot. Other messages in the channel are silently ignored. DM and group DM channels always bypass this filter: a 1:1 (or small-group) direct conversation has no ambient noise to gate against, so every message is treated as addressed to the bot."
msgstr "为 true 时，仅回应 @ 提及该机器人的消息。频道中的其他消息将被静默忽略。私信和群组私信频道始终绕过此过滤器：一对一（或小群组）的直接对话没有需要过滤的环境噪音，因此每条消息都被视为是发给机器人的。"

#: src/channels/discord.md
msgid "When true, only respond to messages that @-mention the bot. Other messages in the guild are silently ignored."
msgstr "为 true 时，仅响应 @ 提及该机器人的消息。服务器中的其他消息将被静默忽略。"

#: src/channels/discord.md
msgid "When true, process messages from other bots (not just humans). The bot still ignores its own messages to prevent feedback loops."
msgstr "为 true 时，处理来自其他机器人的消息（而不仅仅是人类的消息）。机器人仍会忽略自己的消息，以防止反馈循环。"

#: src/channels/discord.md
msgid "When true, register and serve Discord slash commands (e.g. `/ask`) over the Gateway WebSocket, in addition to message handling. Default false. (Prototype: currently registers a single `/ask <prompt>`.)"
