msgid "Wiring up a chat platform? → [Channels](./channels/overview.md)"
msgstr "正在搭建聊天平台？→ [频道](./channels/overview.md)"

#: src/reference/cli.md
msgid "With --new, generates a fresh pairing code even if the gateway was previously paired (useful for adding additional clients). This does NOT revoke existing tokens."
msgstr "使用 --new，即使网关之前已配对，也会生成一个新的配对码（用于添加其他客户端时很有用）。这不会撤销现有令牌。"

#: src/reference/cli.md
msgid "With --rotate, revokes ALL paired bearer tokens, clears the device registry, and issues a fresh code. Use this after a suspected token leak when you do not know which token was compromised; every client must re-pair."
msgstr "使用 --rotate 时，会撤销所有已配对的 bearer 令牌，清除设备注册表，并签发一个新代码。当你怀疑令牌泄露但不知道是哪个令牌被泄露时，请在此之后使用；所有客户端都必须重新配对。"

#: src/reference/cli.md
msgid "With --rotate-device ID, revokes just that device's bearer token and issues a fresh code for re-pairing that one device."
msgstr "使用 `--rotate-device ID` 时，只会撤销该设备的 bearer token，并为重新配对该设备发放一个新 code。"

#: src/getting-started/multi-model-setup.md
msgid "With Ollama, this is a no-text-fallback profile: authorized tools remain configured in `risk_profile`, but text-form tool markup from the model is not executed. Use it for chat-first local agents, or for providers that return native/structured tool calls. If a local model must use ZeroClaw's text fallback tool syntax, set `strict_tool_parsing = false` and keep the other small-model limits."
msgstr "使用 Ollama 时，这是一个无文本回退配置文件：已授权的工具仍在 `risk_profile` 中配置，但模型的文本形式工具标记不会被执行。可将其用于聊天优先的本地智能体，或用于返回原生/结构化工具调用的提供商。如果本地模型必须使用 ZeroClaw 的文本回退工具语法，请设置 `strict_tool_parsing = false` 并保留其他小模型限制。"

#: src/channels/telegram.md
msgid "With `mention_only = true`, mention the bot or reply directly to one of its messages. Direct messages are still processed."
msgstr "使用 `mention_only = true` 时，需要提及机器人或直接回复其消息。私信仍会被正常处理。"

#: src/contributing/agent-policy-parity-harness.md
msgid "With `resolve()` in place (see above), each surface PR follows these steps:"
msgstr "有了 `resolve()`（见上文），每个表层 PR 按以下步骤进行："

#: src/sop/fan-in/mqtt.md
msgid "With a SOP loaded and the MQTT channel subscribed, publish a message to a topic the trigger pattern matches (for example with `mosquitto_pub`, or any broker client). The listener builds an event from the topic and payload and dispatches it. A run starts for every loaded SOP whose `topic` pattern matches and whose `condition` (if any) holds against the payload."
msgstr "在加载了 SOP 且订阅了 MQTT 频道后，将消息发布到触发器模式匹配的主题（例如使用 `mosquitto_pub`，或任何 broker 客户端）。监听器会根据主题和有效载荷构建事件并分发它。对于每个已加载且其 `topic` 模式匹配、并且其 `condition`（如有）对有效载荷成立的 SOP，都会启动一次运行。"

#: src/sop/fan-in/filesystem.md
msgid "With a SOP loaded and the filesystem channel watching a path, write to that path to produce a change the watcher delivers: create, modify, rename, or delete a file inside a watched root. The watcher debounces and settles the change, then dispatches it. A run starts for every loaded SOP whose `path` glob and `events` filter match, and whose `condition` (if any) holds against the change payload."
msgstr "在已加载 SOP 且文件系统通道正在监视某个路径时，向该路径写入内容以产生一个 watcher 会送达的变更：在受监视的根目录中创建、修改、重命名或删除一个文件。watcher 会对变更进行去抖并等待稳定，然后再派发。对于每个已加载的 SOP，只要其 `path` glob 和 `events` 过滤器匹配，并且其 `condition`（如果有）针对变更负载成立，就会启动一次运行。"

#: src/channels/telegram.md
msgid "With an empty peer set, look for `Telegram pairing required; one-time bind code issued`. The structured event includes the channel alias and `pairing_code`. Foreground `zeroclaw daemon` and `zeroclaw channel start` runs also print the code directly. Treat the code and log output as sensitive until the code is consumed."
msgstr "在对等方集合为空时，请查找 `Telegram pairing required; one-time bind code issued`。结构化事件包含频道别名和 `pairing_code`。前台运行 `zeroclaw daemon` 和 `zeroclaw channel start` 时也会直接打印代码。在代码被使用前，请将代码和日志输出视为敏感信息。"

#: src/security/tool-receipts.md
msgid "With receipts"
msgstr "带有收据"

#: src/tools/skills.md
msgid "With reflection enabled, ZeroClaw instead asks the agent's configured model provider to synthesize a canonical [`SKILL.md`](#create-a-markdown-skill) from a **bounded** slice of the execution (the task, the tool-call trace, and the final answer). Every input is independently truncated to a configured character budget so a large execution can never produce an unbounded reflection request:"
msgstr "启用反思后，ZeroClaw 会改为请求代理已配置的模型提供方，从执行的一个**有界**片段（任务、工具调用轨迹和最终答案）中合成一个规范的 [`SKILL.md`](#create-a-markdown-skill)。每个输入都会独立截断到配置的字符预算，因此即使执行规模很大，也绝不会生成无限制的反思请求："

#: src/channels/git.md
msgid "With the GitHub provider, ZeroClaw authenticates as a **GitHub App** and replies as the app's own bot identity (`your-app[bot]`), so it works on any repository the app is installed on. There is no personal access token and no shared user account."
msgstr "使用 GitHub 提供方时，ZeroClaw 会以 **GitHub App** 身份进行认证，并以该应用自己的机器人身份（`your-app[bot]`）回复，因此它可在安装了该应用的任何仓库中工作。没有个人访问令牌，也没有共享用户账户。"

#: src/channels/git.md
msgid "With the Gitea/Forgejo provider, ZeroClaw authenticates with a personal access token against the instance's Gitea-compatible API and replies as the token owner."
msgstr "使用 Gitea/Forgejo 提供程序时，ZeroClaw 会使用个人访问令牌针对实例的 Gitea 兼容 API 进行身份验证，并以该令牌的所有者身份进行回复。"

#: src/hardware/subsystem.md
msgid "With the `hardware` feature, the agent gains these built-in tools:"
msgstr "使用 `hardware` 功能时，该代理将获得以下内置工具："

#: src/getting-started/quickstart.md
msgid "With the daemon running, open the dashboard in a browser:"
msgstr "在守护进程运行的情况下，在浏览器中打开仪表板："

#: src/foundations/fnd-001-intentional-architecture.md
msgid "With the microkernel architecture, the answer is: \"it goes to the kernel's `Channel` receiver, via the `channel-discord` plugin.\" A new contributor can understand the Discord channel completely by reading one plugin crate. They can understand the full agent loop by reading `zeroclaw-kernel` without any channel or tool code in scope."
msgstr "采用微内核架构时，答案是：“消息会发送到内核的 `Channel` 接收端，通过 `channel-discord` 插件。” 新贡献者只需阅读一个插件 crate 即可完全理解 Discord 频道。他们只需阅读 `zeroclaw-kernel`，无需涉及任何频道或工具代码，即可理解完整的代理循环。"

#: src/ops/network-deployment.md
msgid "With this enabled, a non-loopback caller may hit `/admin/reload` **only if it also passes pairing authentication** (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`). Loopback callers (the local CLI) are always allowed and need no token. `/admin/shutdown` and the pairing-code endpoints remain localhost-only regardless of this flag."
msgstr "启用此选项后，非环回（loopback）调用方**只有在同时通过配对认证**（`Authorization: Bearer <token>`）的情况下才能访问 `/admin/reload`。环回调用方（本地 CLI）始终被允许，且无需令牌。无论此标志如何设置，`/admin/shutdown` 和配对码端点都仅限于 localhost 访问。"

#: src/contributing/multi-agent-setup.md
msgid "Without a channel the agent has nowhere to listen. Bind one via the agent's `channels` list, then restart the daemon. The agent picks up its channel on next start."
msgstr "没有通道，代理就无处监听。请通过代理的 `channels` 列表绑定一个通道，然后重启守护进程。代理将在下次启动时获取其通道。"

#: src/channels/nextcloud-talk.md
msgid "Without a resolved secret, ZeroClaw returns `401` before parsing or dispatching the webhook. There is no mode that accepts an unverified request."
msgstr "如果没有解析到密钥，ZeroClaw 会在解析或分派 webhook 之前返回 `401`。不存在接受未经验证请求的模式。"

#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-004-tool-shared-state-ownership.md
msgid "Without a shared contract, new tools risk introducing duplicate state, data leaks between clients, stale state after reloads, or blocking startup validation in the wrong lifecycle phase."
msgstr "如果没有共享契约，新工具可能会引入重复状态、客户端之间的数据泄漏、重载后的陈旧状态，或者在错误的生命周期阶段阻塞启动验证。"

#: src/foundations/fnd-002-documentation-standards.md
msgid "Without an answer to that question, documentation accumulates as a pile of pages that are all slightly different shapes of the same vague category: \"stuff about the project.\" Setup guides live next to architecture decisions. User-facing how-tos sit alongside internal coding standards. Thirty language translations of the README compete for space with the single security policy document. Nobody can find anything, everything goes stale at a different rate, and every PR that touches documentation becomes a negotiation about which pages need updating."
msgstr "如果没有对这一问题的解答，文档就会堆积成一大堆页面，它们都属于同一个模糊类别的不同变体：“关于项目的资料”。设置指南与架构决策并列，面向用户的使用指南与内部编码规范并存。README 的三十种语言翻译与安全策略文档争夺空间。没有人能找到任何东西，所有内容以不同的速度过时，每一个涉及文档的 PR 都变成了一场关于哪些页面需要更新的谈判。"

#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-002-trait-driven-extensibility.md
msgid "Without explicit contracts, every integration would pressure the runtime loop to grow special cases. That would make new integrations faster at first and harder to maintain later: provider routing would leak into channels, tool policy would leak into providers, channel authentication would leak into the agent loop, and memory or logging behavior would be copied across unrelated crates."
msgstr "如果没有明确的契约，每个集成都会迫使运行时循环不断增加特殊分支。这会让新的集成一开始更快，但日后更难维护：provider 路由会泄漏到 channels，tool policy 会泄漏到 providers，channel authentication 会泄漏到 agent loop，而 memory 或 logging 行为会被复制到彼此无关的 crates 中。"

#: src/ops/service.md
msgid "Without lingering, a user-scope systemd service stops when the last session closes."
msgstr "无需停留，用户范围的 systemd 服务会在最后一个会话关闭时停止。"

