#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-006-runtime-channel-plugins.md
msgid "ZeroClaw currently compiles many messaging integrations behind Cargo feature flags. This keeps unused channel code out of selected builds, but adding or updating an optional integration still requires rebuilding the application. It also keeps vendor-specific dependencies and release cadence coupled to the main binary."
