msgstr "ZeroClaw 为现代 64 位 Android 设备发布了预构建的 `aarch64-linux-android` 二进制文件。完整的预构建发布目标集（源自发布工作流）为："

#: src/getting-started/language.md
msgid "ZeroClaw reads a top-level `locale` key from your config. Set it to a locale code such as `ja`, `fr`, or `zh-CN`. If `locale` is unset, ZeroClaw uses your operating system's language and falls back to English when no translation is available."
msgstr "ZeroClaw 会从配置文件中读取顶层的 `locale` 键。请将其设置为区域代码，例如 `ja`、`fr` 或 `zh-CN`。如果未设置 `locale`，ZeroClaw 将使用操作系统的语言，并在没有可用翻译时回退到英语。"

#: src/channels/matrix.md
msgid "ZeroClaw reads identity from Matrix `/_matrix/client/v3/account/whoami`."
msgstr "ZeroClaw 从 Matrix `/_matrix/client/v3/account/whoami` 读取身份信息。"

#: src/ops/cost-tracking.md
msgid "ZeroClaw records every priced API call to an append-only ledger, attributes spend to the originating agent, enforces daily / monthly budgets, and surfaces the rollup on the dashboard `Cost` tab. The pricing rules live in config so operators can edit them without a rebuild."
msgstr "ZeroClaw 会将每一次计费的 API 调用记录到一个仅追加的账本中，将开销归因到发起调用的代理，强制执行每日／每月预算，并在仪表盘的 `Cost` 选项卡中展示汇总数据。计费规则保存在配置文件中，因此运维人员无需重新构建即可对其进行编辑。"

#: src/providers/openai-codex-subscription.md
msgid "ZeroClaw records this slot at `$0` per call. **That is a local accounting limitation, not an OpenAI billing fact:** ZeroClaw cannot see your ChatGPT plan's included-usage meter or credit balance, so it cannot attribute per-call token cost to a subscription request. Read the `$0` as \"not metered by ZeroClaw\", and watch the real allowance / credit state in your OpenAI account. Keep subscription and metered (api-key) classes separate in accounting; see [Cost tracking](../ops/cost-tracking.md)."
msgstr "ZeroClaw 将此槽位记录为每次调用 `$0`。**这是本地计费的局限，而非 OpenAI 实际的计费情况：** ZeroClaw 无法查看你的 ChatGPT 套餐所含用量计量或额度余额，因此无法将单次调用的 token 费用归属到订阅请求。请将 `$0` 理解为“ZeroClaw 未计量”，并在你的 OpenAI 账户中查看真实的额度/信用状态。在计费中请将订阅类和计量（api-key）类分开统计；参见 [成本追踪](../ops/cost-tracking.md)。"

#: src/providers/catalog.md
msgid "ZeroClaw reports vision on the alias and **sends** ACP `{type: image, data, mimeType}` blocks (does not change Grok's advertise)"
msgstr "ZeroClaw 会在别名上报告视觉能力，并**发送** ACP `{type: image, data, mimeType}` 块（不会更改 Grok 的能力声明）"

#: src/hardware/hardware-peripherals-design.md
msgid "ZeroClaw runs **directly on the device**. The board spins up a gRPC/nanoRPC server and communicates with peripherals locally."
msgstr "ZeroClaw **直接在设备上运行**。该板卡会启动一个 gRPC/nanoRPC 服务器，并与外围设备在本地进行通信。"

#: src/setup/freebsd.md
