#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- allow-tools:` and `- deny-tools:` define an explicit per-step tool scope."
msgstr "`- allow-tools:` 和 `- deny-tools:` 定义显式的每步工具范围。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- input:` and `- output:` attach JSON Schema-like step boundary contracts."
msgstr "`- input:` 和 `- output:` 附加 JSON Schema-like 步骤边界契约。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- kind:` accepts `execute` (default) or `checkpoint`. A checkpoint step pauses deterministic execution at that step. Use `requires_confirmation: true` when a step must require approval in any execution mode."
msgstr "`- kind:` 接受 `execute`（默认）或 `checkpoint`。检查点步骤会在该步骤暂停确定性执行。当某个步骤必须在任何执行模式下都要求批准时，请使用 `requires_confirmation: true`。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- mode:` overrides the SOP execution mode for that step."
msgstr "`- mode:` 会覆盖该步骤的 SOP 执行模式。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- next:` and `- depends_on:` route non-linear runs. Ineligible routed steps are marked `skipped` and leave the run `pending` instead of dispatching."
msgstr "`- next:` 和 `- depends_on:` 会路由非线性运行。不符合条件的已路由步骤会被标记为 `skipped`，并使运行保持 `pending`，而不是派发。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- on_failure:` accepts `fail`, `retry:<count>`, or `goto:<step>` and is enforced for reported step failures and output schema failures."
msgstr "`- on_failure:` 接受 `fail`、`retry:<count>` 或 `goto:<step>`，并对已报告的步骤失败和输出 schema 失败强制执行。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- policy:` names an approval-broker policy (a key in `[sop.approval].policies`) that gates this step's approval with required-group membership and quorum. Omit it for an unpoliced gate. A step that names a policy absent from `[sop.approval].policies` fails closed (the gate stays waiting) rather than clearing on a single approval."
msgstr "`- policy:` 指定一个审批代理策略（`[sop.approval].policies` 中的一个键），通过所需组成员资格和法定人数来控制此步骤的审批。若为无策略的关卡，则省略此项。若某步骤指定了一个在 `[sop.approval].policies` 中不存在的策略，则会以失败关闭方式处理（关卡保持等待状态），而不是在单次审批后放行。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- requires_confirmation: true` enforces approval for that step."
msgstr "`- requires_confirmation: true` 强制要求对该步骤进行审批。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- tools:` maps to `suggested_tools`."
msgstr "`- tools:` 映射到 `suggested_tools`。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- when:` guards an explicit `- next:` jump; when the condition is false, the run advances to the next linear step (`current_step + 1`) instead of completing."
msgstr "`- when:` 守卫显式的 `- next:` 跳转；当条件为假时，运行将推进到下一个线性步骤（`current_step + 1`），而不是完成。"

#: src/sop/syntax.md
msgid "`- when:` is a routing guard evaluated against accumulated completed-step outputs after the current step finishes. When it does not match, the run completes instead of dispatching another step."
msgstr "`- when:` 是在当前步骤完成后根据已累积的已完成步骤输出进行评估的路由守卫。如果不匹配，则运行完成，而不是调度另一个步骤。"

#: src/reference/cli.md
msgid "`--agent <AGENT>` — Alias for the new agent. Defaults to a sanitized provider name"
msgstr "`--agent <AGENT>` — 新代理的别名。默认使用已清理的提供程序名称"

#: src/reference/cli.md
msgid "`--agent <AGENT>` — Install into this agent's assigned bundle (defaults to the active agent). When the agent has no bundle, falls back to the global dir"
msgstr "`--agent <AGENT>` — 安装到此 agent 的分配捆绑包中（默认使用当前活动 agent）。当该 agent 没有捆绑包时，回退到全局目录"

#: src/reference/cli.md
msgid "`--agent <AGENT>` — Limit the search to this agent's assigned bundles"
msgstr "`--agent <AGENT>` — 将搜索限制为该代理分配的 bundle"

#: src/reference/cli.md
msgid "`--agent <AGENT>` — Show exactly what this agent loads at runtime (its workspace + open-skills + plugins + assigned bundles). --bundle takes precedence when both are passed"
