#: src/channels/whatsapp.md
msgid "`approval_timeout_secs` bounds that wait. **The default is 300 seconds, and `0` denies immediately** rather than disabling approval, so a zero is a way to refuse every gated tool, not a way to wait forever. On timeout the request is denied and the token is discarded, so a late reply cannot approve a call nobody is waiting on any more."
msgstr "`approval_timeout_secs` 限制该等待时间。**默认值为 300 秒，而 `0` 会立即拒绝**，而不是禁用审批，因此设为零意味着拒绝每个需要审批的工具调用，而不是无限期等待。超时后，请求会被拒绝且令牌会被丢弃，因此延迟到达的回复无法批准任何已经没有人等待的调用。"

