#: src/architecture/localization-catalog-lifecycle.md
msgid "`locales.toml` is the shared registry for locale codes and display labels. It drives docs locale builds and the generated language switcher, and is embedded by the runtime for locale discovery. It does not by itself make every catalog available to every consumer; each loader still defines how its files are embedded or found on disk."
msgstr "`locales.toml` 是语言区域代码与显示标签的共享注册表。它驱动文档的多语言构建和生成的语言切换器，并由运行时嵌入以实现语言区域发现。它本身并不会使每个目录对每个使用者都可用；每个加载器仍需自行定义其文件的嵌入方式或磁盘查找路径。"

