#: src/developing/plugin-protocol.md
msgid "`runtime.rs` strips any caller-supplied `__config` before injecting the resolved section, so the section cannot be spoofed. A channel receives the same typed object as the JSON argument to `configure`. When the manifest requests `config_read` but the host does not effectively grant it, resolution substitutes an empty object and validates that object too. Optional schemas therefore see `{}` (and tools omit an empty `__config`), while a schema with required fields fails closed before the guest starts. A plugin only ever sees its own section. Tool and channel are the current config consumers. The memory world has no config export yet, so memory plugins must not request `config_read` until that ABI and runtime wiring land."
msgstr "`runtime.rs` 会在注入解析后的区段之前移除调用方提供的 `__config`，因此无法伪造该区段。通道接收的类型化对象与传递给 `configure` 的 JSON 参数相同。当清单请求 `config_read` 但宿主实际上未授予该权限时，解析会替换为空对象，并同样对该对象进行验证。因此，可选 schema 会看到 `{}`（工具会省略空的 `__config`），而包含必填字段的 schema 会在 guest 启动前安全失败。插件始终只能看到自己的区段。工具和通道是当前的配置使用者。memory world 目前还没有配置导出，因此在该 ABI 和运行时接线完成之前，memory 插件不得请求 `config_read`。"

