#: src/sop/how-it-works.md
msgid "`sops_dir` is unset by default, so runtime SOP loading is off out of the box. Opt in by setting `sops_dir` through the gateway, zerocode, or `zeroclaw config set`. A relative value resolves against the install root (the directory holding `config.toml`), so the documented `shared/sops` yields `<install>/shared/sops`, the same directory the SOP author writes to. An absolute or `~`\\-prefixed value is used as-is. Setting it back to `\"\"` (or removing it) disables runtime SOP loading again; the CLI still falls back to `<install>/shared/sops` for offline inspection."
msgstr "`sops_dir` 默认未设置，因此默认情况下不会加载运行时 SOP。通过网关、zerocode 或 `zeroclaw config set` 设置 `sops_dir` 即可启用。相对值会根据安装根目录（即存放 `config.toml` 的目录）解析，因此文档中所述的 `shared/sops` 会解析为 `<install>/shared/sops`，也就是 SOP 作者写入的同一目录。绝对值或以 `~`\\-前缀的值将按原样使用。将其重新设置为 `\"\"`（或移除）会再次禁用运行时 SOP 加载；CLI 在离线检查时仍会回退到 `<install>/shared/sops`。"

