#: src/plugins/index.md
msgid "a `Linker` with exactly the imports its world, grants, and adapter support call for: `logging` always, `inbound` for channels, and `wasi:http` for tool and channel adapters only when the manifest grants `http_client`. Memory creates neither an HTTP context nor an HTTP linker. Each adapter cross-checks its context and linker at instantiation (`ensure_http_coherent`)."
msgstr "一个 `Linker`，其导入项恰好满足其 world、grants 和适配器支持所需：始终包含 `logging`，通道包含 `inbound`，仅当 manifest 授予 `http_client` 时才为工具和通道适配器包含 `wasi:http`。Memory 既不创建 HTTP 上下文，也不创建 HTTP linker。每个适配器在实例化时交叉检查其上下文和 linker（`ensure_http_coherent`）。"

